          "text": "Epistaxis"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Small-volume intermittent bleeding for 3 days: streaks of bright red blood in mucus when blowing the nose 1–2 times daily. One brief left-sided drip yesterday after a hot shower, stopped in under 3 minutes with pressure."
      }
